     &#x2F;&#x2F; etc.
</code></pre>
It feels like small incorrect modifications to any of the code here would completely break the function.<p>I&#x27;ve seen stories and articles written by GPT-3 where it will lose the plot and context on the way - in comparison Copilot doesn&#x27;t suffer from this as much? How?

